@host = https://localhost:7180

### run an import
POST {{host}}/api/import

### list (first page, newest first)
GET {{host}}/api/transactions?page=1&pageSize=25&sortBy=transactionTime&sortDir=desc

### filter
GET {{host}}/api/transactions?sourceSystem=Online&status=Active

### single + audit
GET {{host}}/api/transactions/1

###
GET {{host}}/api/transactions/1/audit

### last import runs
GET {{host}}/api/import/batches?take=10
